.TH VC4-QUERY 1 "2026-11-20" "vc4-stack" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vc4-query \- report the VideoCore IV stack's device and driver state
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vc4-query
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vc4-query
prints the engine and daemon versions, the kernel, the V3D revision and QPU
count, the stock core and V3D clocks, die temperature, the throttle register,
CMA total/free, the daemon arena size, the op registry counts, whether the
installed engine carries the training/backward kernels, the system kernel cache
and the installed vc4 package versions.
.PP
It reads
.I /sys/kernel/vc4mon
and runs
.BR vcgencmd .
It never opens
.IR /dev/mem .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Print one JSON object instead of the aligned text report.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 when the report was produced, 1 if the engine library could not be loaded,
2 on a bad argument.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vc4-smi (1),
.BR vc4infer (1),
.BR vc4top (1)
